"Conditions hold now" = "条件当前满足"
"Conditions must hold this long before an automation switches, so a flapping connection does not make items flicker." = "条件需要持续满足这么久，自动化才会切换，以免时断时续的连接让项来回闪烁。"
"Connected" = "已连接"
