"Run command" = "运行命令"
"Running apps" = "正在运行的 App"
"Runs with /bin/sh and a minimal environment. It holds while the command exits with 0. Commands from an import never run until you allow them." = "在最小环境中通过 /bin/sh 运行。命令以 0 退出时视为满足。导入的命令在你允许之前绝不会运行。"
"Script" = "脚本"
"Show Wi-Fi when not connected" = "未连接时显示 Wi-Fi"
"Show an app’s item while it is frontmost" = "App 位于最前面时显示其项"
"Show battery when on battery power" = "使用电池供电时显示电池"
"Show these items while active" = "激活时显示以下项"
"Rolltop can read the name of the current Wi-Fi network." = "Rolltop 可以读取当前 Wi-Fi 网络的名称。"
"Switching…" = "正在切换…"
"System items" = "系统项"
"The backup’s automations are unreadable." = "无法读取备份中的自动化。"
"They appear even when their section is hidden, and hide again by themselves when the automation ends." = "即使它们所在的分区已隐藏，它们也会显示，并在自动化结束时自动重新隐藏。"
"This version of Rolltop does not support this condition; it never holds." = "此版本的 Rolltop 不支持该条件，它永远不会满足。"
"Time" = "时间"
"Time limit" = "时间限制"
"Time limit %lld s" = "时间限制 %lld 秒"
"Timing" = "时机"
"Turn Automation On or Off" = "开启或关闭自动化"
"Unless you switched profiles yourself in the meantime." = "除非你在此期间手动切换了预设。"
"Untitled" = "未命名"
"Wait before switching" = "切换前等待"
"Weekdays" = "工作日"
"Weekends" = "周末"
"When it becomes active" = "激活时"
"When it ends" = "结束时"
"While paused, no automation is active: the items they show hide again, and the profiles they applied are undone where “Restore the previous profile when it ends” is on." = "暂停期间，所有自动化都不会激活：它们显示的项会重新隐藏；开启了“结束时恢复之前的预设”的自动化所应用的预设会被撤销。"
"Wi-Fi" = "Wi-Fi"
"Wi-Fi connected" = "已连接 Wi-Fi"
"Wi-Fi network names" = "Wi-Fi 名称"
"Wi-Fi not connected" = "未连接 Wi-Fi"
"Your automations" = "自动化列表"
